\title{A rule encoding a Horn clause}
\taxon{Example}
\date{2026-01-15}
\author{JB00}
\import{macros}

##{\text{If } (\text{student}, \text{name} : x) \text{ Then Add } (\text{person}, \text{name} : x).}

\p{This is the production rule that encodes the Horn clause #{\forall x\, (\text{student}(x) \subset \text{person}(x))}.}
